# Build context for the backend image (Dockerfile: `COPY . .` in the deps stage,
# then the runner copies /app wholesale). Anything not listed here ends up in
# the image, so secrets and local artefacts must be excluded here.
#
# What the image needs at runtime and must stay: package.json + lockfiles,
# src/ (incl. src/contracts/*.json), prisma/ (schema + migrations), config/,
# public/, scripts/ (operators run them inside the container), env.example,
# nodemon.json/tsconfig.json/next.config.ts, and the four keys_fixed/ files the
# code reads (see the end of this file).

# --- Environment files: never bake configuration or secrets into the image ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
# Copies and variants with a suffix after ".env": backend.env.test,
# backend.env.bak, backend.env.20260930, prod.env.local, ...
**/*.env.*
# env.example has no secrets and documents every variable; it stays.
!env.example

# --- Key material ---------------------------------------------------------
# keys/ is not read by the runtime (native-login only reads keys/jwks.json when
# it exists, as a deny-list, and pins the same thumbprint in code).
keys/
**/*.pem
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/*.jks
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
# JWK signing keys (native-login's file signer reads one from
# DDC_AUTH_SIGNING_KEY_FILE; it must be mounted, never baked in).
**/*.jwk
**/*.jwk.json
# Credential files and directories that tools drop into a checkout.
**/secrets/
.npmrc
.netrc
.aws/

# --- VCS, editor and OS files ---------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
.debug/

# --- Dependencies: installed inside the image by the deps stage ------------
# A host node_modules would overwrite the Linux build (`COPY . .` runs after
# `yarn --frozen-lockfile`) with macOS binaries.
**/node_modules
.npm
.yarn/cache
.yarn/unplugged
.yarn/install-state.gz
.pnp.*
*.tgz
.eslintcache

# --- Docker files themselves -----------------------------------------------
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
docker-compose*.yaml

# --- Tests, docs and local tools -------------------------------------------
# Operator scripts for the server (deploy/new-stack); never part of the backend image.
deploy/
test/
src/**/*.test.js
coverage/
.nyc_output/
docs/
*.md
load-test-*.js
debug-duplicates.js
test-real-duplicate.sh
eslint.config.mjs

# --- Local data, logs and runtime output from a dev checkout ---------------
# ./db is the Postgres data directory of the commented-out compose service.
# src/uploads/ only holds multer temp files that the snapshot controller
# deletes after use; the route recreates the directory at boot. public/ is
# left whole on purpose: the app serves and reads files under it.
db/
logs/
**/*.log
tmp/
temp/
uploads/
src/uploads/
cleaned-data/
data-pack-*.csv
build/
dist/
out/
.next/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vercel

# --- keys_fixed/: only the files the running code opens ---------------------
# src/controllers/passWebServiceController.js builds an APNs provider from
# keys_fixed/apn_key.p8 when the module loads (the app does not boot without
# it), and src/controllers/passController.js reads the three Wallet pass
# certificates. Every other file in keys_fixed/ (backups, .p12 exports, ...)
# stays out. These come last so they win over the key patterns above.
# Moving them to a read-only mount instead of the image is the follow-up once
# the keys are rotated (reports/2026-09-29-公开仓库中的密钥.md).
keys_fixed/*
!keys_fixed/apn_key.p8
!keys_fixed/wwdr.pem
!keys_fixed/signerCert.pem
!keys_fixed/signerKey.pem
